  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till EU-kommissionens Ukraina-facilitet, pelare I, 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the EU Commission&apos;s Ukraine Facility Pillar I 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till EU:s Ukrainafacilitetpelare I avser att bidra till att t&#xe4;cka det akuta finansieringsgapet i den ukrainska budgeten 2026. St&#xf6;det till den ukrainska statsbudgeten bidrar till att pensioner och l&#xf6;ner i offentliga system kan utbetalas, v&#xe5;rd, skola och omsorg kan uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;llas samt det ukrainska samh&#xe4;llets motst&#xe5;ndskraft st&#xe4;rkas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to the EU&apos;s Ukraine Facility Pillar I is intended to help cover the financing gap in the Ukrainian budget in 2026. Through this support to the Ukrainian state budget, pensions and salaries in public systems can be paid, healthcare, education and social care can be maintained and the resilience of Ukrainian society is strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
